        {
          "text": "Ine, ne Daniele nalinakwike kabili naponene mukulwala pa nshiku ishakupenda. Nasuka napuputuka no kubwelela ku milimo intu imfumu yampeele. Icimonwa cena calintiinishe, calimpapwishe pantu nshailwike umo calolele.",
